('096-5028','نشانگر سرویس فیلتر هوای Cat 096-5028','Cat Air Filter Service Indicator؛ بدنه پلاستیک قالب‌گیری‌شده/پلی‌کربنات، رزوه 1/8-27 NPT، ریست دستی و نمایش مقاومت جریان هوا.','Filters & Fluids - Air Filter Service Indicator','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/096-5028','Official Cat page lists Marine Engine and Marine Auxiliary groups plus generator, industrial and land equipment. No price or stock published.','REFERENCE',true,now(),'https://caterpillar.scene7.com/is/image/Caterpillar/CM20260505-b659b-c841f?fmt=WebP&hei=960&iccembed=0&layer=COMP&op_sharpen=0&op_usm=1%2C1%2C6%2C0&printres=72&qlt=88%2C1&resmode=sharp2&wid=960','{"thread":"1/8-27 NPT","material":"Molded plastic / Polycarbonate","reset":"Manual"}'::jsonb,'BOTH','Cat lists Marine Engine and Marine Auxiliary model groups plus land, generator and industrial equipment.','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/096-5028'),
('0R-3652','دینام بازسازی‌شده Cat Reman 0R-3652','Cat Reman Alternator سری N؛ عنوان رسمی 24V-55A و مشخصه صفحه خروجی نامی 52 آمپر را نشان می‌دهد. نوع نصب Spool، 12 قطب و برس‌دار.','Electrical & Electronics - Alternator','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/0R-3652','Official Cat Reman page. Product title states 24 Volt-55 Amp while specifications list rated output 52.0 amps. Cat page explicitly states Marine Approved: No. No price or stock imported.','REFERENCE',true,now(),'https://caterpillar.scene7.com/is/image/Caterpillar/CM20220113-021dc-940e5','{"voltage_v":24,"title_rated_output_amp":55,"spec_rated_output_amp":52,"mount_type":"Spool","number_of_poles":12,"brush_type":"Brush"}'::jsonb,'LAND','Official Cat page explicitly lists Marine Approved: No; compatible groups include truck, industrial, generator and land equipment.','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/0R-3652'),
('0R-2741','شاتون بازسازی‌شده Cat Reman 0R-2741','Cat Reman Connecting Rod برای خانواده موتورهای 3100/C7؛ صفحه رسمی آن را به‌عنوان شاتون بازسازی‌شده معرفی می‌کند.','ENGINE INTERNAL / ROTATING COMPONENT','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/0R-2741','Official Cat page identifies Cat Reman Connecting Rod (3100/C7). Alternate part references are displayed separately; no supersession or universal fitment is inferred. No price or stock imported.','REFERENCE',true,now(),'https://caterpillar.scene7.com/is/image/Caterpillar/CM20220427-6a2c6-0addb','{}'::jsonb,'UNVERIFIED','Official page identifies 3100/C7 family but retrieved evidence does not establish a complete marine-versus-land application list.','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/0R-2741'),
('100-4838','پیچ فلنج‌دار شش‌گوش Cat 100-4838','پیچ فلنج‌دار شش‌گوش M6؛ فولادی با پوشش روی. طول پیچ 0.787 اینچ و طول گیرایی 0.098 اینچ طبق مشخصات رسمی.','Hardware, Seals & Consumables - Fasteners','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/100-4838','Official Cat page. M6 hexagonal flange head bolt; steel, zinc plated. Compatible groups include generator, truck engine, integrated toolcarrier and wheel tractor-scraper. No price or stock imported.','REFERENCE',true,now(),'https://caterpillar.scene7.com/is/image/Caterpillar/CM20190730-47115-60bbb?fmt=webp&hei=162&wid=162','{"thread_size":"M6","material":"Steel","coating":"Zinc","bolt_length_in":0.787,"grip_length_in":0.098,"hex_size_in":0.31}'::jsonb,'LAND','Official Cat compatible groups shown are generator, truck engine, toolcarrier and wheel tractor-scraper.','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/100-4838'),
('100-4841','پیچ فلنج‌دار شش‌گوش Cat 100-4841','پیچ فلنج‌دار شش‌گوش M6؛ فولادی با پوشش روی. طول پیچ 0.394 اینچ و طول گیرایی 0.098 اینچ طبق مشخصات رسمی.','Hardware, Seals & Consumables - Fasteners','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/100-4841','Official Cat page. M6 hex flange head bolt; steel, zinc plated. Compatible groups include generator, integrated toolcarrier, wheel tractor-scraper and compactor families. No price or stock imported.','REFERENCE',true,now(),'https://caterpillar.scene7.com/is/image/Caterpillar/CM20190109-35244-51781','{"thread_size":"M6","material":"Steel","coating":"Zinc","bolt_length_in":0.394,"grip_length_in":0.098,"hex_size_in":0.31}'::jsonb,'LAND','Official Cat page lists generator, integrated toolcarrier, wheel tractor-scraper, skidder and compactor groups.','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/100-4841'),
('100-6668','تیغه برش باکت Cat 100-6668','تیغه برش پیچ‌شونده باکت Cat، ضخامت 30 میلی‌متر، موقعیت راست/چپ، فولاد بور، اتصال Bolt-on و سه سوراخ نصب.','Ground Engaging Tools - Bucket Cutting Edges','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/100-6668','Official Cat page identifies a 30 mm bolt-on bucket cutting edge, RH/LH, boron steel, loader application. Compatible models include loader families such as 972, 966, 962, 950 and 980. No price or stock imported.','REFERENCE',true,now(),'https://caterpillar.scene7.com/is/image/Caterpillar/CM20250131-637f2-7dd14','{"thickness_mm":30,"position":"RH/LH","material":"Boron Steel","attachment":"Bolt-on","hole_quantity":3,"length_in":55.098}'::jsonb,'LAND','Official Cat page classifies this as a loader bucket cutting edge and lists wheel-loader and track-loader families.','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/100-6668'),
('101-0745','تیغه برف‌پاک‌کن 600 میلی‌متری Cat 101-0745','تیغه برف‌پاک‌کن 600 میلی‌متری؛ رنگ مشکی مات و آداپتور از پیش نصب‌شده برای نصب سریع‌تر. صفحه رسمی آن را قطعه دید کابین معرفی می‌کند.','Cabs - Cab Visibility - Windshield Wipers','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/101-0745','Official Cat page. 600 mm windshield wiper blade; matte black with pre-mounted adaptor. Compatible groups include multi-terrain loader, skid steer, soil compactor, backhoe loader, wheel dozer, landfill compactor and wheel loader. No price or stock imported.','REFERENCE',true,now(),'https://caterpillar.scene7.com/is/image/Caterpillar/CM20240410-a45aa-b2591','{"blade_length_mm":600,"color":"Matte black","adapter":"Pre-mounted"}'::jsonb,'LAND','Official Cat page lists land-machine cab visibility and wiper applications.','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/101-0745'),
('101-3895','پیچ فلنج‌دار شش‌گوش M8 Cat 101-3895','پیچ فلنج‌دار شش‌گوش M8؛ فولادی با پوشش روی. طول پیچ 1.378 اینچ و طول گیرایی 0.512 اینچ طبق مشخصات رسمی.','Hardware, Seals & Consumables - Fasteners','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/101-3895','Official Cat page. M8 hex flange head steel bolt, zinc plated. Compatible groups include generator, truck engine, toolcarrier, scraper, skidder and compactor families. No price or stock imported.','REFERENCE',true,now(),'https://caterpillar.scene7.com/is/image/Caterpillar/CM20190109-33340-54848','{"thread_size":"M8","material":"Steel","coating":"Zinc","bolt_length_in":1.378,"grip_length_in":0.512,"hex_size_in":0.39}'::jsonb,'LAND','Official Cat page lists generator, truck engine, toolcarrier, scraper, skidder, compactor and forestry groups.','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/101-3895'),
('103-1912','استاد دو سر رزوه مقاوم به خزش Cat 103-1912','استاد دو سر رزوه M10 x 1.5 مقاوم به خزش و دمای 400°C برای توربوشارژر؛ فولادی، پوشش روغنی ضدخوردگی و دارای پچ قفل‌کننده. طول کلی 1.77 اینچ.','Hardware, Seals & Consumables - Engine Fasteners','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/103-1912','Official Cat Parts Store result identifies M10 x 1.5 creep-resistant 400°C turbocharger interference stud. Compatible groups shown include generator, engine C7.1, track loader, wheel loader, motor grader, excavator and industrial engine. No image, price or stock inferred.','REFERENCE',true,now(),NULL,'{"thread":"M10 x 1.5","temperature_rating_c":400,"material":"Steel","overall_length_in":1.77,"nut_end_thread_length_mm":25,"stud_end_thread_length_mm":15,"coating":"Oil corrosion inhibitor","locking_patch":true}'::jsonb,'LAND','Official Cat result lists generator, industrial engine, track loader, wheel loader, motor grader and excavator groups.','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/103-1912'),
('106-8916','پیچ فلنج‌دار شش‌گوش M6 Cat 106-8916','پیچ فلنج‌دار شش‌گوش M6؛ فولادی با پوشش روی، از مجموعه اتصالات و قطعات تعمیر موتور Cat.','Hardware, Seals & Consumables - Engine Fasteners','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/106-8916','Official Cat page. M6 hex flange head bolt; steel, zinc plated. Retrieved page did not provide a complete compatible-model list, so machine fitment remains unverified. No price or stock imported.','REFERENCE',true,now(),'https://caterpillar.scene7.com/is/image/Caterpillar/CM20190109-33340-58039','{"thread_size":"M6","material":"Steel","coating":"Zinc"}'::jsonb,'UNVERIFIED','Official Cat page confirms part identity and specifications but retrieved evidence does not establish machine application.','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/106-8916')
